iness days.</p>\n    </div>\n  </form>\n</section>", "with": "<section class=\"photo-card-31\" aria-labelledby=\"photo-heading-31\">\n  <style>\n    .photo-card-31 {\n      max-width: 32rem;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 1.5rem;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n      border-radius: 0.5rem;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n      font-size: 1.375rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #0f172a;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 .intro {\n      margin: 0 0 1.5rem;\n      font-size: 0.9375rem;\n      color: #334155;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 .field {\n      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 label.field-label {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;\n      font-size: 0.875rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #1e293b;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 input[type=\"email\"],\n    .photo-card-31 textarea {\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      min-height: 2.75rem;\n      padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      border: 1px solid #64748b;\n      border-radius: 0.375rem;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      font: inherit;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 textarea {\n      min-height: 6rem;\n      resize: vertical;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 .check-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 0.75rem;\n      min-height: 2.75rem;\n      padding: 0.5rem 0;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 input[type=\"checkbox\"] {\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      width: 1.25rem;\n      height: 1.25rem;\n      margin-top: 0.125rem;\n      accent-color: #0f172a;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 .check-label {\n      font-size: 0.9375rem;\n      color: #1e293b;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .photo-card-31 .hint {\n      margin: 0.375rem 0 0;\n      font-size: 0.8125rem;\n   